= Senator Padmé Amidala of Naboo

The former Queen of Naboo is young, fearless and already one of the most respected voices in the Senate. She also knows Palpatine better than almost anyone.

[? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : *Our advisors can act again in [+ advisor_action_timer +] turn(s).* ?]

- @amidala_naboo: Naboo’s voice.
- @amidala_anakin: Speak with Anakin Skywalker.
- @amidala_moderates: Rally the moderates.
- @go_back: Back.

@amidala_naboo
subtitle: +1 faith and more support in the Mid Rim.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: faith += 1; midrim_rc += 2; advisor_action_timer = 5

Senator Amidala’s appeal for honest government carries a special weight. Everyone remembers the Queen who stood up to the Trade Federation.

@amidala_anakin
view-if: anakin_found and date >= 132
subtitle: His trust in the Chancellor wavers a little.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: anakin_fall -= 1; advisor_action_timer = 5

Padmé and Anakin talk for hours, about Tatooine, the war and the Chancellor’s kindness to him. She does not tell him what she fears. She asks him what he fears.

@amidala_moderates
subtitle: +5 relations with the Core Moderates and Independents.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: Our advisors have already acted recently.
on-arrival: mod_relation += 5; ind_relation += 5; advisor_action_timer = 5

Padmé spends a week of late nights with moderate senators who have stopped listening to anyone. They listen to her.
